OL,3,ABrand moved from Wandsworth to category
OL,4,AC prison, his wife confirms on podcast
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Brand returned to the couple's
OL,7,Fpodcast on Sunday, saying that she had
OL,8,Fspoken to her husband in prison and he
OL,9,F"is OK and is praying". Brand has
OL,10,Fpositioned himself as a Christian
OL,11,Finfluencer, and has a large following
OL,12,Famong believers, including in the US.
